西元前二五六年）","scope":"digital_editorial_regnal_year_equivalence_only","image_verified":false}],"rationale":"本篇承接五十九年秦攻西周而王赧卒；通鑑卷五同年明言赧王崩，數位年標前256年。暫定天文年-255，不補月日，不合併西周君與赧王。固定修訂ID尚未取得，頁面核讀日期2026-10-11。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"basis":{"kind":"parallel_event","source_event_quote":"周君、王赧卒","reference_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hant/資治通鑑/卷005","reference_event_quote":"是歲，赧王崩。","reference_year_quote":"赧王五十九年（乙巳，西元前二五六年）"},"record_id":"le-shiji004-079","person_id":"8r8_law_3lz","date_role":"life_event","event_type":"death"}],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p073","text":"慎靚王立六年，崩，子赧王延立。王赧時東西周分治。王赧徙都西周。","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m073-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"慎靚王","kind":"person","person_id":"4yr_em4_wid","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m073-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"赧王延","kind":"person","person_id":"8r8_law_3lz","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m073-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"王赧","kind":"person","person_id":"8r8_law_3lz","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m073-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"王赧","kind":"person","person_id":"8r8_law_3lz","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-004-zhou","book_id":"b-shiji-004","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-004-zhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p079","text":"王赧謂成君。楚圍雍氏，韓徵甲與粟於東周，東周君恐，召蘇代而告之。代曰：「君何患於是。臣能使韓毋徵甲與粟於周，又能為君得高都。」周君曰：「子茍能，請以國聽子。」代見韓相國曰：「楚圍雍氏，期三月也，今五月不能拔，是楚病也。今相國乃徵甲與粟於周，是告楚病也。」韓相國曰：「善。使者已行矣。」代曰：「何不與周高都？」韓相國大怒曰：「吾毋徵甲與粟於周亦已多矣，何故與周高都也？」代曰：「與周高都，是周折而入於韓也，秦聞之必大怒忿周，即不通周使，是以獘高都得完周也。曷為不與？」相國曰：「善。」果與周高都。","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m079-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"王赧","kind":"person","person_id":"8r8_law_3lz","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m079-0003","start":3,"